                <pb facs="0317" n="137" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg137"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—No official record of the substance of the conversation at this meeting has been
                        found.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d710a-30-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d710a-30-f1" n="2" xml:id="d710a-30-f1-content">
                <p>Fragments of the conversation, as recalled by Sergeant Eugene List (who played
                    the piano for Truman and his guests), are reported in <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >The New Yorker</hi>, December 29, 1945, p. 15.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
